            <div xml:id="d647">

                <pb facs="0801" n="727" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg727"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.7111/14</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Rumania</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Andrews</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-05T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 5, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>51. Your 122, August 22. Dr. Constantin
                        Anghelescu entirely agreeable to this Government as Minister from
                    Roumania.</p>
                <p>In conveying this information to the Roumanian Government say that in view of the
                    critical international situation and the earnest desire of the United States to
                    assist Roumania immediately and in every practical and material way, the
                    Government of the United States would be pleased if Doctor Anghelescu could be accompanied by Roumanian
                    experts who could discuss with American officials the best means of assisting
                    Roumania. This Government will endeavor to send aid without awaiting arrival of
                    commission if it can be advised of most vital needs of Roumania.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
